stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Ready
  Ready --> Infiltrating: start raid
  Infiltrating --> Infiltrating: move / jump / wall-grab / slide
  Infiltrating --> GraffitiActive: activate limited graffiti ability
  GraffitiActive --> Infiltrating: effect resolved
  Infiltrating --> Chasing: detected
  Chasing --> Infiltrating: reach alternative route
  Chasing --> Captured: no valid escape
  Captured --> CheckpointRestart: accept second chance
  Captured --> Reset: decline second chance
  CheckpointRestart --> Chasing: resume with penalties
  Reset --> Ready: lose treasure and restart
  Infiltrating --> TreasureSecured: steal treasure
  TreasureSecured --> Escaping: begin extraction
  Escaping --> Completed: reach exit
  Escaping --> Chasing: detected during escape
  Completed --> Scored: calculate combined score
  Scored --> Rewarded: claim rewards
  Rewarded --> [*]
